      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>HACCP is not a checklist you buy. It is a way of thinking. Work out what can go wrong. Decide where you control it. Keep proof. The law asks every UK food business for a system based on it. The test of a HACCP checklist app is simple: is the diary done at the check, or the night before inspection?</p>"
