      "kind": "takeaways",
      "heading": "The short version",
      "html": "<ul><li>UK food businesses need a system based on the seven HACCP principles. The law is Regulation (EC) 852/2004.</li><li>Safer Food Better Business (SFBB) is the FSA's ready-made system for small caterers.</li><li>The plan is built once with a competent person. The diary is filled in every shift.</li><li>An EHO inspects the records: temperature, cleaning, deliveries, allergens.</li><li>An app does not write your plan. It shows the daily checks happened, with photos and times.</li><li>£75 per month per phone number & unlimited free dashboard accounts.</li></ul>"
